Design system
-------------
The grid, type scale and interaction rules are ported from lightphone/light-sdk,
which is MIT licensed. ic_settings_white.xml, ic_back_white.xml and
ic_refresh_white.xml are that project's own files, used unchanged under the same
licence, so the bars look like every other bar on the phone. The remaining icons
are drawn for this app.

Sounds
------
All notification sounds are generated at build time by scripts/. No sampled or
recorded audio is included in this repository or in the built APK.

scripts/ref_tracks.json contains measured articulation parameters — formant
frequencies and bandwidths, pitch, level, voicing — derived by analysis from a
reference recording. It is a description of articulation, not audio, and no part
of any recording is reproduced by it or by the synthesizer it drives.
